{# The home page's frame around a page (0491, review/shell.py), included by page_header.html.j2 for the
   pages of SHELL_PAGES: the sidebar (the home page, the five stages, share, the tools, the meerkat, the
   version, the theme switch) fixed on the left, the page shifted right of it; the top bar (☰ on a phone,
   the page's name, its chapter in both languages, *Back to the home page*) where the thin bar was. The
   page's space is highlighted. Its ids (`homeLink`) and classes (`mh-doc`, `mh-page`) are the thin bar's:
   home_link.html.j2 handles the way back the same. #}
{% set shell = header.shell %}
<script nonce="{{ page_nonce }}">
{% include "theme_choice.js.j2" %}
document.documentElement.classList.add("mh-shelled"{% if shell.compact %}, "mh-shell-compact"{% endif %}{% if shell.drawer %}, "mh-shell-drawer"{% endif %});
</script>
<style>
{% include "shell.css.j2" %}
</style>
{% include "home_icons.svg.j2" %}
{% include "shell_side.html.j2" %}
{% include "shell_top.html.j2" %}
<script nonce="{{ page_nonce }}">
{% include "shell.js.j2" %}
</script>
